# OS and filesystem cruft
.DS_Store
.fuse_hidden*

# Working notes for Lesley and Claude only. This repo is PUBLIC, and the
# notes name people, record which copy is unconfirmed, and write down
# risks that have been accepted rather than resolved. None of that
# belongs in front of visitors. Kept local; never committed.
CLAUDE.md

# Unrelated working art — icon sources and loose photos that aren't
# referenced by any page. Excluded deliberately, not overlooked.
images/fish_*
images/hook_*
images/embedded_icon_*
images/steering-wheel-detail.jpg
images/steering-wheel-detail-portrait.jpg

# Test dependencies. history-scroll.test.js needs jsdom and css-tree:
#   npm install jsdom css-tree && node history-scroll.test.js
# That drops ~26 MB / ~1800 files here. The test itself IS committed;
# only what npm fetches for it is ignored.
node_modules/
package-lock.json

# Project files (docs, build scripts, photo/video originals) live in the
# sibling folder "BB Project Files", deliberately outside this repo — no
# ignore rule can leak them. These patterns are a safety net for originals
# that land here before being processed.
#
# Convention: compress a new original to ~1400px wide JPEG, quality 82,
# progressive, into images/ with a lowercase-hyphenated name.
*.original
*(original*
**/_originals/
